  <Lines>k__BackingField:
  - <Npc>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 44ec2a6625f7a934dab5754819bfeb2e, type: 2}
    <Expression>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 368af27e801a8f643a3763179d93db07, type: 2}
    <Text>k__BackingField:
    - "Je me sens oppress\xE9."
    - "\xC7a couvre toute ma vision avec un chiffon, je me sens envahi, et Liski
      est trop proche de moi."
  - <Npc>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6d7f1579677957f4989c5da3f93a4c8d, type: 2}
    <Expression>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f0358eca1d351f540a61dc689202b2b8, type: 2}
    <Text>k__BackingField:
    - "Je comprends bien, mais je dois bien laver ton bocal \xE0 un moment."
  - <Npc>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 44ec2a6625f7a934dab5754819bfeb2e, type: 2}
    <Expression>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3d35d0e1530830e42b12a5e80d0329dc, type: 2}
    <Text>k__BackingField:
    - "Oui mais tu peux le faire d\u2019un peu plus loin\u2026"
